      "content": "hey so i was watching the latest interview with [Celebrity Name]—the one from last night—and i noticed something really weird with their facial movements. like, when they laughed at the joke, their eyes didn't quite sync up with the mouth movement, it looked almost... robotic? like there was a slight delay or an unnatural twitch. i know people say it's just lighting or editing but it felt way off. as someone who studies behavior, does that sound like a normal micro-expression to you or is that something weird?",
